==Blog Update: Monday, November 20th==
'''Update, 16:30 GMT, November 20th: We've hotfixed the Leagues drop rates for Revenant weapons and some Phantom Muspah uniques. Slayer task modifiers should now correctly apply to the Revenant weapons (on top of your Leagues drop modifiers) and drop modifiers should apply correctly to the Phantom Muspah.'''

'''Note: This week's game update will take place on Thursday, November 23rd instead of the usual Wednesday update. This is to allow us more time to develop more significant fixes.'''

To say that Trailblazer Reloaded has exceeded our expectations would be the understatement of the century! We're over the moon to see so many of you (literally more than ever before) enjoying Leagues and ticking off tasks 'til the cows come home.

To paraphrase another trailblazer: with great popularity comes great responsibility. With that in mind, we'd like to give you all a quick update on outstanding issues that we're working on fixes for so that you know what's being adjusted and can plan ahead for any tasks or activities you might have been putting off for the time-being. The majority of these are things we're hoping to fix alongside this week's game update, though some might need a little more time before we're able to adequately fix them and feature in next week's game update instead.

===Upcoming changes, working to fix as many as possible this week===

* Players receiving Emote clue steps requiring items that aren't obtainable within their region. Additionally, other steps (some Fairy Ring and Falo clues, for example) that weren't completable should be receiving fixes too.
* 'Receive a Magic seed from a bird's nest' task not completing properly.
* Players who select the Farmer's Fortune relic can't complete the task for casting Ressurect crops and protecting crops. The task will complete when you attempt to perform that action following a fix, even if you're unable to benefit from the action.
* Players obtaining pets from Tombs of Amascut or the Desert Treasure II bosses aren't receiving completion for the 'Receive a Boss pet' task. This will also complete retroactively for players who've already obtained a pet from any of the impacted content.
* Colossal Hydras aren't providing Slayer points to players with the Bloodthirsty relic when killed.
* Bloodthirsty feels pretty underwhelming in some regions, we're looking to add some low level superiors (e.g. Bloodvelds) into some regions' Slayer task lists to alleviate this. For example, players with Kandarin unlocked can kill Bloodvelds but cannot be assigned them without Morytania, we'll be looking to update some of these instances.
* Add a toggle to Infernal Gathering for instances where players want to keep more resources. You'll still benefit from the speed, but be able to disable the 'burning' effect.
* Revenant weapons drops not benefitting from the 5x on-task modifier.
* Some Phantom Muspah drops not benefitting from Leagues drop-rate modifiers.
* Some Pyramid Plunder 'killcount' tasks not updating correctly. These will be completed retroactively once fixed.
* Gout Tubers are rarer than they should be.
* Enchanted bolt special effects don't apply healing via the Soul Stealer relic.
* Ghosts Ahoy is auto-completed with a Fremennik region unlock, but doesn't complete the corresponding task.
* Client of Kourend is auto-completed with a Fremennik region unlock, but doesn't complete the corresponding task.
* Granite Maul special attacks aren't hitting as intended.
* Trailblazer tools are weaker than intended on the Path of Het inside Tombs of Amascut.
* The task for completing Elemental Workshop I will be removed, since this task is auto-completed during the Leagues Tutorial and cannot be completed by players.
* Sulliuscep mushroom caps are rarer than intended due to multipliers boosting other drops.
That's all we've got so far, but we're always on the lookout for any more feedback and issues so if you've run into any roadblocks that aren't listed here, let us know and we'll get working on fixing them as soon as possible!

Now get back to gaming, those League Points aren't gonna earn themselves!

