==Leagues IV: Trailblazer Reloaded==
The agonising wait is over! Today the Leagues game mode makes its triumphant return with the launch of Leagues IV: Trailblazer Reloaded.

In this reimagining of our most popular League ever, you’ll return to the area-locking mayhem of Leagues II: Trailblazer. With a few tweaks to Relics and tasks, and access to all the content we’ve added since the original League, this is a truly unique experience – and we can’t wait for you to play it!

We’ve been drip-feeding teasers and reveals over the last two weeks, as well as answering some of your most frequently asked questions. See ‘em all on [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/a=97/leagues-iv-faqs--teasers---releasing-november-15th?oldschool=1 the blog], where you’ll also learn everything you need to know about Leagues.

If reading isn’t really your scene, we have a special message from our famous content creators, who want YOU to know which areas they like the look of. &nbsp;

<center><big><big>[https://www.youtube.com/embed/xDiSMO5SAWg?si=OIuKLxZgWswLKq7i Trailblazer Reloaded | An Area Guide ft. Settled, Solo Mission, Torvesta and More]</big></big></center>
<center>''If for any reason you can't see the video above, [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xDiSMO5SAWg click here to be whisked away to our YouTube channel].''</center>

If you’ve been paying close attention to the reveals, you’ll know your old strategies from the original Trailblazer are of no use here – so you’ve got a lot of theorycrafting to do! Luckily, Mod Husky’s Game Jam project means we have the technology to let you browse all the available tasks and plan your next steps no matter what you’re up to. [https://twitter.com/OldSchoolRS/status/1719767912272076891 Take a look by clicking here]!

Leagues IV will run from now until January 10th – and we’re here to fill you in on everything you need to know.

