===Tasks===
To unlock regions and gain more Relics, you’ll need League Points – and to get League Points, you’ll need to complete some tasks. These fun challenges are scattered relatively evenly across all available areas – so feel free to pick your favourites!

We’ve teamed up with the OSRS Wiki team to bring you the entire task list on [https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Trailblazer_Reloaded_League/Tasks one incredibly useful page]. This makes it easy to plan your route and choose your Relics to suit your favourite tasks – remember, strategy is key!

===Relics===
Choosing a Tier 1 Relic is the first decision you’ll need to make. These powerful items bestow all kinds of helpful buffs and boons – but choose wisely, because they’re permanent!

To help you out, here’s a rundown of the Tier 1 Relics:

====Endless Harvest====

* 2x resources gathered from Fishing, Woodcutting and Mining. Bonus resources provide bonus XP.
* Resources gathered by this Relic are sent directly to your Bank if there’s space. Otherwise, they are placed in your Inventory.
* Items that normally can’t be banked will be placed into your Inventory regardless of how much space you have.

====Production Prodigy====

* When doing the following activities, all items are processed at once:
** Smelting ores, Smithing bars and making Cannonballs.
** Fletching logs, stringing Bows and cutting bolt tips.
** Cleaning herbs and making Potions which don’t have a stackable secondary ingredient.
** Cooking food and making Jugs of Wine.
** Crafting leather, uncut gems, glassblowing, jewellery, pottery, Battlestaves and spinning flax or wool.
* You’ll receive full XP for all items processed using this Relic.
* There’s a 25% chance that you’ll make an extra product, which will be sent straight to your Bank! This additional product will also earn you XP.
* Crafting, Smithing, Herblore, Fletching and Cooking are all boosted by +12.

====Trickster====

* You will automatically re-pickpocket your target.
* Loot from pickpocketing is doubled and noted.
* Coin pouch limit is multiplied by 3.
* You’ll be given the Sage’s Greaves, that grant Agility XP that scales with your Agility level while running.
* Box traps lure creatures faster.
* Loot from box traps is doubled.
* Impling jars can’t break.
* You can burn up to nine logs simultaneously.
* You can’t fail actions for Thieving, Agility, Hunter and Firemaking.

Pretty cool, huh? Well, that’s only the first three! You can find information about every single Relic [https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Trailblazer_Reloaded_League/Relics over on the OSRS Wiki] – or, you can keep it a surprise and discover the others as you rise through the ranks.

Alternatively, you can check out this jam-packed infographic (once again, made by GentleTractor) to refer back to while you're progressing!

