===Rewards and Trophies===
League Points aren’t just for new areas and Relics - you’ll be able to spend them on some fiery new rewards, too! From the hottest fits to the coveted League banner, from new animations to ornament kits – the Leagues Rewards Shop has it all.

As well as a new range of Trailblazer Reloaded-themed cosmetics, you can also purchase all the rewards you missed from previous Leagues. Likewise, if you have Points left over from previous Leagues, you can still spend them on new rewards!

[[File:Leagues IV - Trailblazer Reloaded (12).gif|385px|center]]


[[File:Leagues IV - Trailblazer Reloaded (13).gif|428px|center]]


[[File:Leagues IV - Trailblazer Reloaded (14).gif|thumb|401px|center|''Here's a sneak-peak at some of the animation overrides on offer this League!'']]


To get your mitts on the goods, just hop back to the main game and speak to the Leagues Tutor in Catherby.

Please note that he’ll need a bit of time to set up his wares – to avoid nasty bugs, we’re not allowing players to purchase items from the Leagues Reward Store, or claim Trophies, until a couple of days after the League launches.

Speaking of Trophies, we’ve made some big changes this year! Our new static point threshold approach to HiScores ensures that you can be certain exactly how many League Points you need to earn each Trophy. Just like previous Leagues, there’s a Trophy for each tier on the HiScores, from basic Bronze all the way up to the coveted Dragon tier. &nbsp;

To make it even easier to see where you stack up, we’ve added the exact Point thresholds to your in-game Leagues menu. Take a peek!

[[File:Leagues IV - Trailblazer Reloaded (15).jpg|300px|center]]

Well, it seems we’ve nothing further to tell you. It’s time for you to gear up, put on your travellin’ boots, and head out into the wild world of Leagues IV: Trailblazer Reloaded. We can’t wait to see where you’ll go! Good luck – and have fun!

