==Other Changes==
* Halloween has officially ended, so we’re dusting off the cobwebs and putting away the pumpkins. Congratulations to all you ghouls and ghosts for absolutely smashing the Cauldron milestones!
* The Sinister Offering spell no longer consumes Long and Curved Bones, as they are of more use to players in Dorgesh-Kaan.
* In Last Man Standing, the combat option on other players is now always left-click, regardless of their combat levels outside the minigame.
* This change entails using ‘Fight’ rather than ‘Attack’ for the option, as players may remember from the old Duel Arena.
* The Slayer Skill Cape perk which allows you to reassign your previous task is now available at Spria, for any 99s who still hang out with her.
* The Soulreaper Axe now sends a message to alert players that its stacks will be lost when unequipped. This message can be blocked by the standard filter.

